{
  "v": 2,
  "order": 145,
  "label": "Cards from files",
  "group": "Tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -480,
      "y": 60,
      "init": {
        "label": "Cards from files",
        "body": "# Cards from files\nThree CSV files from the demo vault's **Data** folder (crew, products and orders), read by Local File nodes and run through table verbs.\n\nOrders join to a product lookup on SKU and to a rep lookup on the rep's full name, and a Keep picks the fields an order card needs.\n\nOpen any Frame chip and switch the popup to **Cards**: the photos and product pictures are `data:image` cells, and the cards pick their title, headline number, chips, stars and meters from the columns.\n\nOn desktop, point **Settings ▸ Data** at your own folder and the same nodes read your files.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crew",
      "type": "LocalFileNode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -640,
      "init": {
        "label": "Crew",
        "fileName": "crew.csv"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "products",
      "type": "LocalFileNode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 380,
      "init": {
        "label": "Products",
        "fileName": "products.csv"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "orders",
      "type": "LocalFileNode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1160,
      "init": {
        "label": "Orders",
        "fileName": "orders.csv"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crew-remote",
      "type": "FilterFrameNode",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -1000,
      "init": {
        "label": "Filter → remote crew",
        "condConfig": {
          "0": {
            "op": "eq"
          }
        },
        "valueKeys": [
          "frame",
          "column0",
          "value0"
        ]
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "column0": "Remote",
        "value0": "TRUE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crew-sort",
      "type": "SortFrameNode",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -660,
      "init": {
        "label": "Sort → rating, best first",
        "dir": "desc"
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "column": "Rating"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rep-name",
